      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound silence, isn't it? The quiet after the noise of a life you poured everything into. What you're feeling is the natural, agonizing echo of a life suddenly stripped of its anchor. Please, just let the quiet be the beginning of something else, something that doesn't have to be this heavy.",
